            </p>
          </CalculatorCard>
          <CalculatorCard>
            <h4 class="text-primary font-bold mb-2">
              <a href="/pt/learn/battery-energy-density-chart/" class="hover:text-m-blue-light transition-colors">Gráfico de Densidade de Energia</a>
            </h4>
